<title>UK: Credit local sets 300 bln lire four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit local sets 300 bln lire four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IMI Lux, BNL and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Crdit Local de France</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN ITL   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    27.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.381   PAY DATE    27.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR/IT</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
